title: "Stacked 2D-3D GNN for Multi-Label GHS Hazard Classification"
abstract: >-
  Code, dataset and trained weights for a stacked 2D-3D graph neural network
  that predicts all 22 consolidated GHS hazard classes simultaneously from
  molecular structure.
type: software
license: MIT
